[[14,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Fix the alternator in a vice at the bench.</p><p>1. Use the special tool (1a) to keep the shaft still and undo the pulley fixing nut (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.973.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125005337.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[14,1,0,"<p>1. Recover the washer (1a) and remove the pulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125005338.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[14,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pulley and shaft are not damaged.</p><p>1. Reposition the pulley in the housing.</p><p>2. Reposition the washer in the housing and tighten the nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125005339.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[14,1,0,"<p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) fixing the pulley, using the special tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.973.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125005340.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]